{"from": "Nariway Check-in <signals@nariway.com>", "to": ["alina@nariway.com"], "subject": "Nariway Check-in - 2026-08-22", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Nariway Check-in</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:wght@400;500;600&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#FFFFFF; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; text-size-adjust:100%;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF; margin:0; padding:0;\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 20px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:620px; width:100%;\">\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 0 6px 0;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:'Newsreader', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight:500; font-size:28px; line-height:1.2; color:#1A1A17; letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Nariway Check-in</span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 0 28px 0;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#6B6B62;\">22 August 2026</span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-size:1px; line-height:1px;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- DASHBOARD -->\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:28px 0 12px 0;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6B6B62;\">Dashboard</span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#1A1A17;\">Paid engagements</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-weight:600; font-size:18px; color:#1A1A17; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#1A1A17;\">Real situations</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-weight:600; font-size:18px; color:#1A1A17; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#1A1A17;\">Client discovery conversations</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-weight:600; font-size:18px; color:#1A1A17; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#1A1A17;\">Signal-ladder high-water mark</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; color:#1A1A17;\">&ldquo;I&rsquo;ve seen this problem&rdquo;</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:14px 0 0 0; font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#6B6B62;\">\n<strong style=\"color:#1A1A17;\">Evidence.</strong> Core thesis H7A holds at LOW (first support, from Erskine). 5 hypotheses moved this week via disconfirmation passes <span style=\"color:#3F6B4A;\">&#9650;</span> (from 4) &mdash; H6/H8, H2, H3, and a new pass narrowing &ldquo;ownership &ne; access&rdquo; without reversing it.\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:8px 0 0 0; font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#8A8A80;\">\n<strong style=\"color:#6B6B62;\">Engine.</strong> Conversations: 3 published / 3 in progress / 3 awaiting reply. Cases coded: 73 of ~75 <span style=\"color:#3F6B4A;\">&#9650;</span> (from 65). Demand-side responses: ~1.\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; padding-top:28px;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- NEEDS YOU TODAY -->\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:28px 0 12px 0;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6B6B62;\">Needs you today</span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#0A0A0A;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\"><strong>Delete the line-68 sentence, open a fifth straight QA audit.</strong> <em>what-becomes-of-great-art-collections.md</em> still says wealth-manager art-service adoption has &ldquo;roughly doubled since 2011&rdquo; &mdash; the causal reading the claims register forbids, since the 2023&rarr;2025 trend actually reversed. The correct wording already sits two lines below it. Two minutes, not new research.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\"><strong>Name what &ldquo;settled&rdquo; means for the Notes pause.</strong> The 8/17 pause waits on &ldquo;3 to 5 conversations proving the spine.&rdquo; That count passed 5 two days ago and nothing has moved since; both stewards have now flagged it four days running. Pick a bar (a workable default: 3 conversations live on the site, not just accepted) or say explicitly why not yet.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0 0;\"><strong>Whitney Biennial closes tomorrow, Aug 23.</strong> Free hours 5&ndash;8pm today if a look matters before it's gone; the field's largest recurring survey of American art.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; padding-top:28px;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- OPERATOR'S READ -->\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:28px 0 12px 0;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6B6B62;\">Operator&rsquo;s read</span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 0 0 0; font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-weight:500; font-size:19px; line-height:1.5; color:#1A1A17;\">\nTwo cheap decisions, the QA line and what &ldquo;settled&rdquo; means, have sat unmade for four days while the research engine quietly closed in on its case target without you.\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; padding-top:28px;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- TODAY I LEARNED -->\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:28px 0 12px 0;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6B6B62;\">Today I learned</span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#0A0A0A;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Owning a work outright and putting it in public custody isn&rsquo;t what keeps a collection visible; getting matched to a museum that actually wants that specific work is. Vogel's &ldquo;Fifty Works for Fifty States&rdquo; placed 2,500 works into public custody across all 50 states, one museum each, and sustained public view was never confirmed. Souls Grown Deep's Collection Transfer Program did the opposite &mdash; 500+ works placed selectively since 2016, matched to curatorial interest &mdash; and produced two decades of real exhibition life, including a first-ever Tate Modern acquisition in 2025. Same legal outcome, opposite result, because one program matched supply to demand and the other didn't.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E7E5DF; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; padding-top:32px;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:20px 0 0 0; font-family:'Manrope','Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; color:#8A8A80;\">\nNariway Check-in &middot; board-voice, metrics-anchored, no fabrication.\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}